          %h2#references References
          %p The condition to be an enhanced factorisation system was observed in the following, though the concept was not isolated:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A.+J.+Power"}> A. J. Power
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em A general coherence result
              %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0022-4049%2889%2990113-8"} doi:10.1016/0022-4049(89)90113-8
              %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=985657"} MR0985657
          %p Enhanced factorisation systems were defined in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stephen+Lack"}> Stephen Lack
              \.
              = succeed "." do
                %em Codescent objects and coherence
